<title>THAILAND: Samart Corp 1996 net profit up slightly.</title>
<headline>Samart Corp 1996 net profit up slightly.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated financial results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		7.19	vs		7.10</p>
<p>    Net		     499.98	vs	    474.79</p>
